@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> DisplayRecommendations: Display personalized recommendations
DisplayRecommendations --> ViewProductDetails: View product details
ViewProductDetails --> PurchaseProduct: Purchase product
DisplayRecommendations --> FilterRecommendations: Filter recommendations
FilterRecommendations --> DisplayFilteredRecommendations: Display filtered recommendations
DisplayFilteredRecommendations --> ViewProductDetails
DisplayRecommendations --> SaveFavorites: Save favorite products
SaveFavorites --> UpdateFavorites: Update favorites list
UpdateFavorites --> DisplayRecommendations
DisplayRecommendations --> DisplayPurchaseHistory: Display purchase history
DisplayPurchaseHistory --> ViewProductDetails
DisplayRecommendations --> DisplayProductInfo: Display detailed product info
DisplayProductInfo --> ViewProductDetails
DisplayRecommendations --> DisplayUserFeedback: Display user feedback
DisplayUserFeedback --> DisplayProductInfo
DisplayRecommendations --> SearchProducts: Search for products
SearchProducts --> DisplaySearchResults: Display search results
DisplaySearchResults --> ViewProductDetails
DisplayRecommendations --> [*]: Exit
@enduml
